Since I couldn't find any infos on IPS formats i hacked around it for
like 10 minutes and came up with this.


Format of an IPS (International Patching System)

MAJIC         : 5 chars = "PATCH"
Address       : 3 chars
patch size    : 2 bytes
bytes to byte : ? char  (size of the patch size)
.. if more than one area to patch, start at Address again
   and follow thru
EOF           : 3 chars = "EOF"


PATCHaaappb?aaappb?EOF <-- ips patch with 2 chunks



